      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Hoping for glowing press coverage, Corinna walks up to Alessandro with notebook in hand and mistakes the intern for Repubblica journalist Antonio Di Pollina. Before Alessandro can explain, she dictates her berry-scented shower routine and invites him to a beach calendar shoot — right as Rene secretly orders Arianna to throw the intern out. Listen to the Italian scene first without trying to catch every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
